---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About
permalink: /
description: Connect your Velocity proxy and Minecraft servers. Send commands between them in any direction, with no code and no player online.
---
<style>
  /* height of the shared sticky header at each breakpoint */
  .lp { --lp-header: 45px; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .lp { --lp-header: 49px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .lp { --lp-header: 57px; } }
  .lp-wrap { width: min(100% - 2rem, 72rem); margin-inline: auto; }

  /* the copy scrolls on the left while the globe stays pinned on the right */
  .lp-story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .lp-visual { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; position: sticky; top: var(--lp-header); height: calc(100vh - var(--lp-header)); }
  .lp-visual canvas { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .lp-labels { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .lp-labels span { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); transition: color 200ms; text-shadow: 0 0 3px hsl(var(--background)), 0 0 6px hsl(var(--background)); }
  .lp-labels span.is-on { color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }
  .lp-copy { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
  .lp-block { min-height: calc(100vh - var(--lp-header)); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }

  .lp-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.6vw, 3.75rem); line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -0.045em; font-weight: 600; text-wrap: balance; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .lp-hero p { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 28rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .lp-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .lp-step .lp-n { font: 0.875rem ui-monospace, monospace; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); margin-bottom: 0.875rem; }
  .lp-step h2 { font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 3.6vw, 2.75rem); letter-spacing: -0.035em; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .lp-step p { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 24rem; }

  .lp-facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); border-block: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .lp-facts > div { padding: 2.25rem 1.5rem; }
  .lp-facts > div + div { border-left: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
  .lp-facts svg { width: 1.375rem; height: 1.375rem; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .lp-facts h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .lp-facts p { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; }

  .lp-proof { text-align: center; font: 0.8125rem ui-monospace, monospace; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); margin-top: 3rem; }
  .lp-proof span + span::before { content: "·"; margin: 0 0.75rem; }
  .lp-proof [hidden] + span::before { content: none; }

  .lp-closing { text-align: center; padding: 7.5rem 0 8rem; }
  .lp-closing h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.4vw, 3.25rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .lp-closing .lp-actions { justify-content: center; }
  .lp-closing p { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 0.9375rem; margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  .lp-closing p a { color: hsl(var(--foreground)); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; text-decoration-color: hsl(var(--border)); }
  .lp-closing p a:hover { text-decoration-color: currentColor; }
  .lp-closing .lp-compat { font: 0.75rem ui-monospace, monospace; margin-top: 0.875rem; }
  .lp-compat span { display: inline-block; margin: 0.125rem 0.625rem; }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    /* phones and tablets: the globe stays pinned at the top while the copy scrolls underneath */
    .lp-story { display: block; }
    .lp-visual { height: 44vh; z-index: 10; background: hsl(var(--background)); }
    .lp-block { min-height: auto; padding: 2rem 0; }
    .lp-hero { padding-top: 0.5rem; }
    .lp-hero p, .lp-step p { font-size: 1rem; }
    .lp-hero .lp-actions a { flex: 1 1 100%; }
    .lp-step { min-height: 56vh; justify-content: flex-start; }
    .lp-labels span { font-size: 0.75rem; }
    .lp-facts { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .lp-facts > div { padding: 1.5rem 1rem; }
    .lp-facts > div:nth-child(3) { border-left: none; }
    .lp-facts > div:nth-child(n + 3) { border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
    .lp-closing { padding: 4.5rem 0 5.5rem; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .lp-labels span { transition: none; } }
</style>

<div class="lp">
  <section class="lp-wrap lp-story" aria-label="What CommandBridge does">
    <div class="lp-visual" data-globe aria-hidden="true">
      <canvas></canvas>
      <div class="lp-labels" data-globe-labels></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-copy">
      <div class="lp-block lp-hero">
        <h1>Connect your network. Let your plugins talk.</h1>
        <p>Send commands between your proxy and servers, in any direction. No code, no player online.</p>
        <div class="lp-actions">
          <a class="button !h-11 !px-5 !text-[0.9375rem]" href="https://modrinth.com/plugin/commandbridge#download" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download on Modrinth</a>
          <a class="button-outline !h-11 !px-5 !text-[0.9375rem]" href="/docs/{{ docVersions.latest }}/">Read the docs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-block lp-step" data-globe-step><div class="lp-n">01</div><h2>One to one</h2><p>A plugin on one server runs a command on another.</p></div>
      <div class="lp-block lp-step" data-globe-step><div class="lp-n">02</div><h2>One to all</h2><p>One command reaches every server at once.</p></div>
      <div class="lp-block lp-step" data-globe-step><div class="lp-n">03</div><h2>Any direction</h2><p>Proxy to server, server to server. Everything can talk.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-wrap lp-facts" aria-label="Highlights">
    <div>{% lucide "code-xml" %}<h3>No code</h3><p>Set it up, don't program it.</p></div>
    <div>{% lucide "plug" %}<h3>Works with any plugin</h3><p>If it runs commands, it works.</p></div>
    <div>{% lucide "hourglass" %}<h3>Never misses a player</h3><p>Queued until they join, even after a restart.</p></div>
    <div>{% lucide "shield-check" %}<h3>Secure by default</h3><p>Every connection is authenticated and encrypted.</p></div>
  </section>

  <p class="lp-wrap lp-proof"><span data-downloads hidden></span><span>Open source</span><span>v{{ docVersions.latest }}</span></p>

  <section class="lp-wrap lp-closing" aria-label="Get CommandBridge">
    <h2>Connect your network.</h2>
    <div class="lp-actions">
      <a class="button !h-11 !px-5 !text-[0.9375rem]" href="https://modrinth.com/plugin/commandbridge#download" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download on Modrinth</a>
      <a class="button-outline !h-11 !px-5 !text-[0.9375rem]" href="/docs/{{ docVersions.latest }}/">Read the docs</a>
    </div>
    <p>Questions? Ask on <a href="https://discord.gg/QPqBYb44ce" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> or browse the source on <a href="https://github.com/objz/CommandBridge" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.</p>
    <p class="lp-compat"><span>Velocity · Paper · Folia · Spigot · Purpur</span><span>Minecraft 1.20 and newer</span><span>Java 21</span></p>
  </section>
</div>

<script>
  // live download count from Modrinth; if the API can't be reached the item stays hidden
  fetch("https://api.modrinth.com/v2/project/commandbridge")
    .then((r) => (r.ok ? r.json() : Promise.reject(new Error("Modrinth API " + r.status))))
    .then((project) => {
      const el = document.querySelector("[data-downloads]");
      el.textContent = new Intl.NumberFormat("en", { notation: "compact", maximumFractionDigits: 1 }).format(project.downloads) + " downloads";
      el.hidden = false;
    })
    .catch((error) => console.warn("Download count unavailable:", error.message));
</script>
<script src="/js/d3-array.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/d3-geo.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/topojson-client.js" defer></script>
<script type="module" src="/globe.js?build={% now %}"></script>
